(
    title: "Enduro",
    developer: Some("Larry Miller"),
    description: Some("An endurance race across changing days rather than laps: pass 200 cars before the first dusk, 300 every day after, or the race ends at daybreak. The button is your accelerator — held longer for more speed, released with a pull back to brake — while the road itself fights you: ice deadens the steering, fog shortens your sight, and at night the traffic shrinks to pairs of tail lights. Survive five days and an on-screen trophy appears; Activision\'s Roadbusters patch awaited a photo of it."),
